  "rhythm": "Twitch owner credit: Acry. First ten 4/4 bars of Songsterr s2388331 at its 120 BPM: exactly the opening 20 seconds. The ocarina follows Track 1's repeating upper pulse, Track 5's chromatic melody in bars 3-4, Track 7's rising orchestral line in bars 7-8, then returns to the pulse. Quarter-beat gaps are joined to the next onset so the ocarina remains continuous; high notes are folded down exactly one octave with no key change. Songsterr s29363 independently confirms the 120 BPM, repeating opening pulse, chromatic bars, bass entrances, and percussion sections. The linked Stubz1989 OoT-soundfont mix is the timbral reference. Band parts map the source voices to supported OoT choir, strings, trombone, finger bass, and custom drums.",
